{"id":"c096df80861122dd","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-consistency.md","title":"KF相对于ε0以下分层真理的一致性","display":"thm-KF-consistency — KF相对于ε0以下分层真理的一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-KF-consistency"],"display":"thm-KF-consistency — KF相对于ε0以下分层真理的一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-consistency — KF相对于ε0以下分层真理的一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-KF-consistency-—-KF-相对于-$\\varepsilon_0$-以下分层真理的一致性\">thm-KF-consistency — KF 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下分层真理的一致性</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span> (标准全归纳 Kripke–Feferman 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 以下的迭代分层真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\\)</span>\n(元理论中的句法一致性)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]\\)</span>\n(矛盾证明的有效归约)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF})\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF})\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准 KF 的算术后果与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span> 对应；相应证明变换\n把 KF 的矛盾证明归约为该分层理论的矛盾证明，所以这里首先得到元理论\n中的相对一致性。若要把它内部化成某个基础理论所证明的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 蕴含，还须形式化该证明变换。极小强 Kleene 固定点也\n提供外部语义模型，但把这个构造形式化到何种基础理论中需要单独分析。</p>\n<p>PA 不能证明标准 KF 的一致性。因为 KF 扩展 PA 且证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>；若一致 PA 还能证明\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})\\)</span>，便会在 PA 内推出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>，违反第二不完备定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-KF-consistency-—-KF-相对于-$\\varepsilon_0$-以下分层真理的一致性","text":"thm-KF-consistency — KF 相对于 $\\varepsilon_0$ 以下分层真理的一致性","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\neg\\exists p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_S(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(U,V)\\coloneqq\n\\forall p\\,[\\mathrm{Prf}_U(p,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)\n\\to\\exists q\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_V(q,\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Red}_{\\bot}(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0})\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathrm{KF})\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{KF})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false}],"bytes":1898,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typ